<p>We want you to pay for tududi Cloud only if it is working for you.</p>

<h2>First payment: 14-day money-back</h2>
<p>If tududi Cloud is not for you, email <a href="mailto:<%= operator.email %>"><%= operator.email %></a> within 14 days of your first payment and we will refund it in full, no questions asked. This applies to both monthly and yearly plans.</p>

<h2>Renewals</h2>
<p>Renewal payments are not refunded, but you can cancel at any time from Profile &rsaquo; Billing and you will not be charged again. You keep access until the end of the period you have already paid for.</p>
<p>If you forgot to cancel a yearly plan and contact us within 14 days of it renewing without having used the service since, we will refund that renewal too.</p>

<h2>Our mistakes</h2>
<p>If you were charged twice, charged after cancelling, or could not use the service because of a problem on our side, tell us and we will put it right, including a refund where appropriate.</p>

<h2>If we shut down</h2>
<p>If we ever close tududi Cloud, we will refund any unused prepaid time on yearly plans.</p>

<h2>How refunds are paid</h2>
<p>Payments are processed by Lemon Squeezy, our merchant of record, so refunds go back to the original payment method through them. They usually arrive within 5 to 10 business days, depending on your bank.</p>

<h2>Your legal rights</h2>
<p>This policy adds to, and does not replace, any rights you have under consumer law where you live. EU and UK consumers have a right to withdraw from a purchase within 14 days; the money-back guarantee above covers that period in full.</p>
